A blank name in a multi-name struct-field group is skipped, not made a provider,
mirroring scanVar. Only A provides int here, so there is no ambiguity. Contrast
err_ambiguous_multiname_struct_field, where both A and B provide int.
-- config --
import-path: example.com/app
package-name: app
-- example.com/app/a.go --
package app

type C struct {
	//plumb:build
	A, _ int
}

//plumb:build
func NewC() C { return C{} }

//plumb:build
func Use(n int) string { return "" }
